# Purpose/owner: shared typed native SQL acceptance runner test deadline.
# Type/units: integer seconds, permitted range 5..600; nonsecret.
# Optional override; shared default is 90. This M25 elapsed-retention profile uses
# 180 so its real 90-second history wait plus setup/cleanup cannot be cut short.
# Precedence/mapping: protected --execution-env-file overrides test_seconds in
# --execution-configuration through training_target_configuration.load; becomes
# the Go test deadline and outer deadline plus configured capture grace.
# Copy into an owned 0700 parent as a 0600 file; no secret value is present.
# Effect: next validation invocation only; no application restart/rebuild/reload.
PROJECT_ONE_MYSQL_TRAINING_TARGET_TEST_SECONDS=180
